%% ============================================
%% APPENDIX E: READING PLAN
%% ============================================
\chapter*{Appendix E: A Reading Plan for 2 Corinthians 哥林多後書讀經計劃}
\addcontentsline{toc}{chapter}{Appendix E: A Reading Plan for 2 Corinthians 哥林多後書讀經計劃}
\markboth{Appendix E: A Reading Plan 讀經計劃}{Appendix E: A Reading Plan 讀經計劃}

\section*{十三日讀經計劃 A Thirteen-Day Plan (一天一章 One Chapter a Day)}

\begin{small}
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.25}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{1.3cm}p{2.3cm}p{3.0in}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{天 Day} & \textbf{經文 Passage} & \textbf{焦點 Focus} \\
\midrule
1 & 1:1-24 & 患難中的安慰、誠實的事奉 \textit{Comfort in Affliction, Sincerity of Ministry} \\
2 & 2:1-17 & 饒恕修復、基督馨香之氣 \textit{Forgiveness, the Aroma of Christ} \\
3 & 3:1-18 & 新約執事、榮上加榮 \textit{Ministers of the New Covenant, Glory to Glory} \\
4 & 4:1-18 & 光照人心、瓦器中的寶貝、永恆眼光 \textit{The Light of the Gospel, Jars of Clay, Eternal Perspective} \\
5 & 5:1-21 & 天家盼望、和好的職分 \textit{Our Heavenly Dwelling, the Ministry of Reconciliation} \\
6 & 6:1-18 & 分別為聖、永生神的殿 \textit{Set Apart, the Temple of the Living God} \\
7 & 7:1-16 & 敞開心門、依神的意思憂愁 \textit{Open Hearts, Godly Sorrow} \\
8 & 8:1-24 & 恩典的奉獻、忠心的管理 \textit{The Grace of Giving, Faithful Stewardship} \\
9 & 9:1-15 & 甘心樂意、感恩榮神 \textit{The Cheerful Giver, Thanksgiving and Glory to God} \\
10 & 10:1-18 & 屬靈爭戰、真實的權柄 \textit{Spiritual Warfare, True Authority} \\
11 & 11:1-33 & 純正的福音、以軟弱誇口 \textit{The Pure Gospel, Boasting in Weakness} \\
12 & 12:1-21 & 身上的一根刺、恩典夠用 \textit{The Thorn in the Flesh, Sufficient Grace} \\
13 & 13:1-14 & 自我省察、三一的祝福 \textit{Self-Examination, the Trinitarian Blessing} \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
\end{small}

\vspace{0.4cm}

\section*{四週讀經計劃 A Compressed Four-Week Plan (小組查經適用 For Group Study)}

\begin{small}
若時間有限，可依循原24課主日學進度，每主日一課，約六個月讀畢全書；亦可壓縮為四週查經，大致對應全書兩部：\\
\textit{For those following the original 24-lesson Sunday School pace, one lesson per Sunday covers the whole book in about six months. Alternatively, the thirteen chapters may be compressed into a four-week group study, roughly following the book's two parts:}
\end{small}

\vspace{0.2cm}

\begin{small}
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{1.6cm}p{2.0cm}p{3.4in}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{週 Week} & \textbf{經文 Passage} & \textbf{主題 Theme} \\
\midrule
第一週 & 1-3章 & 患難中的安慰與新約執事的憑據 \textit{Comfort in Affliction, the Credentials of a New Covenant Minister} \\
第二週 & 4-7章 & 瓦器中的能力、天家盼望、和好與分別為聖 \textit{Power in Jars of Clay, Heavenly Hope, Reconciliation and Holiness} \\
第三週 & 8-10章 & 恩典的奉獻與屬靈爭戰 \textit{The Grace of Giving, Spiritual Warfare} \\
第四週 & 11-13章 & 護衛純正福音、身上的刺、愛中的權柄 \textit{Guarding the Pure Gospel, the Thorn, Authority in Love} \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
\end{small}

